```json
{
 "mcpServers": {
 "bookshop": {
 "command": "uv",
 "args": ["run", "--with", "mcp[cli]", "mcp", "run", "/absolute/path/to/server.py"]
 }
 }
}
```

The same `command` plus `args`, under the same `mcpServers` key Claude Desktop uses. The server appears in Cursor's MCP settings with both tools listed.

